//! Acceptance test for AC4 (MUST) — generated by `autobuilder scaffold`.
//!
//! Project: self-portrait (cli)
//! AC description: When the file does not exist in the current HEAD but did historically (e.g. it was deleted), the extractor still walks the history — exits 0 with all commits in `commits` and a top-level `"deleted_at": "<RFC3339>"` field. If the file never existed under any name, exits with code 3 and stderr containing the path and `no commits found`.
//! Test predicate: tests/acceptance_ac4.rs
